            <ArticleTitle>Comparison of focal boost high dose rate prostate brachytherapy optimisation methods.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>521-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.radonc.2015.09.021</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0167-8140(15)00503-4</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For HDR prostate brachytherapy treatments of 15 Gy to the whole gland plus focal boost, optimisation to either tumour plus margin (F-PTV) or involved sectors was compared. For 15 patients median F-PTV D90 and V150 were 21.0 Gy and 77.2% for F-PTV optimisation and 19.8 Gy and 75.6% for sector optimisation.</AbstractText>
